WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.659
What does SCP-999 taste like?

00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:05.430
Come on, you were all thinking it!

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.110
We were just brave enough to say it.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.460
The most obvious answer is peanut butter,
but we feel like orange-flavored jello is

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.700
equally likely.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.439
Given his diet consists solely of sugar, he’s
also likely to taste incredibly sweet.

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:21.439
Some have reported him smelling like crispy
bacon, which is also a possibility.

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:25.380
Maybe, as part of his commitment to making
everyone happy, he’d taste like whatever

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.730
your favorite food is!

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:31.909
I’m beginning to think he’s in containment
to protect him from us…..what savages we

00:00:31.909 --> 00:00:33.609
are...savages.

